WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:05.780
Monsters have been part of storytelling for
pretty much as long as there have been stories.

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:10.910
One of the oldest known stories today is the
epic of Gilgamesh, who has to face a terrifying

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:16.119
demon in order to gain access to a forbidden
forest. This hasn´t changed today and we

00:00:16.119 --> 00:00:21.310
are still fascinated by these monsters. Maybe
even more so than ever. They represent our

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:27.029
greatest fears and embody the dread we feel
in the face of evil and catastrophe. Monsters

00:00:27.029 --> 00:00:31.990
allow us to visualize these fears and help
us deal with them more easily. This usually

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:37.610
plays out in either one of two ways: Option
one, the Hero and the Monster fight until

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:42.710
one of them is defeated. This can for example
be seen in stories like Harry Potter, where

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:47.830
the mystery and terror of the monster steadily
grows, until it is finally defeated. Option

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:53.180
two basically twists this common expectation
and upon confrontation, the monster turns

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:58.830
out to be an ally or not even a monster after
all. A great example for this is King Kong,

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:04.040
a giant, terrifying gorilla that ends up protecting
the humans on his island. The world of One

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:09.330
Piece is no different and is filled with countless
evils and monsters itself, that the straw

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:14.360
hat crew either has to face in battle or ends
up fighting alongside with. There is one very

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:18.970
special case in the story though, that takes
a very different approach to the concept of

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:22.640
the monster.
I think it is fair to say that Chopper is

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:27.570
one of the more overlooked members on Luffy´s
crew. Which is surprising, because being a

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:32.640
reindeer, that ate the human human fruit and
that ended up becoming a sweet-loving doctor,

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:37.700
in many ways makes him the most fantastical
Nakama on the ship. And yet, despite of this

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:43.000
bizarre and extremely unique character concept,
Chopper ended up getting less and less attention

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:48.700
by the readers as time passed. And as we will
find out later, there is one big problem within

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:53.050
Chopper´s writing, that I believe takes a
lot of tension out of his character. And it

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:57.900
is not what you think it is. Because for many
people, it seems that Chopper has been turned

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:02.600
into a sort of cute mascot for the crew. But,
even if Oda has deliberately turned Chopper

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:07.530
into an obvious piece of “kawaii” merchandise,
he is still a well set-up and natural-feeling

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:12.129
character in the way he was presented in the
story. As a matter of fact, I will argue that

00:02:12.129 --> 00:02:17.620
Chopper has had the most complete character
arc out of all the straw hats so far. Therefore,

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:21.870
in this video we are going to look at why
our Cotton Candy loving reindeer is a great

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:26.099
example of excellent character writing, how
his development arc is different from the

00:02:26.099 --> 00:02:32.049
other straw hats and where Oda might have
made one big mistake. So, who is Chopper and

00:02:32.049 --> 00:02:37.299
what qualifies him to be a straw hat?
We first get to meet Tony Tony Chopper on

00:02:37.299 --> 00:02:43.239
Drum Island, shortly after entering the grand
line. Chopper grew up as a reindeer in the

00:02:43.239 --> 00:02:48.450
mountains of the island, where he was treated
as an outcast by his herd and even his parents,

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:53.060
because of his blue nose. When he later ate
the human human fruit and suddenly acquired

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:58.319
human-like intelligence he was banished completely
from his herd. When trying to communicate

00:02:58.319 --> 00:03:04.280
with the humans on the island he was called
a monster, chased away and badly wounded.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:09.219
He was finally taken in by the good-hearted
Dr. Hiriluk who took care of Chopper and inspired

00:03:09.219 --> 00:03:14.160
him to become a doctor. When Hiriluk´s health
worsened significantly over time though, Chopper

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:19.329
set out to find a cure for his new found father
figure. During his search he encounters his

00:03:19.329 --> 00:03:24.120
old herd once more and is forced to fight
the leader. He manages to win but is heavily

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:29.239
wounded in the process again. After he makes
it back to the house, barely alive, out of

00:03:29.239 --> 00:03:34.340
sheer gratefulness Hiriluk eats the mushroom
Chopper found, well knowing it contains a

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:39.199
deadly poison. He later tragically commits
suicide to not burden his son with being the

00:03:39.199 --> 00:03:44.319
reason for his death. After this once again
major blow of destiny, Chopper is then taken

00:03:44.319 --> 00:03:49.480
in by Dr. Kureha, who tells him the truth
about the deadly mushroom, but then goes on

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:53.959
to take him in and teach him real medicine
in the isolation of her castle.

00:03:53.959 --> 00:03:58.379
What this shows us right from the beginning,
is that Chopper has basically been an outcast

00:03:58.379 --> 00:04:03.659
for all of his life until he meets Luffy.
He is a reindeer and a human and yet seems

00:04:03.659 --> 00:04:08.959
to be accepted by neither. Both have shown
him nothing but violence and hatefulness.

00:04:08.959 --> 00:04:14.299
In the end Chopper grew up with the impression
of being an abnormity. A monster that doesn´t

00:04:14.299 --> 00:04:19.200
have a place in society. Considering that
he is only 15 when joining the crew, I would

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:22.849
argue, that this counts as a truly tragic
backstory.

00:04:22.849 --> 00:04:27.550
As a result of this, we get introduced to
Chopper´s character having a couple of clear

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:34.139
weaknesses: He has a clear lack of self-confidence,
is very shy and has serious trust issues.

00:04:34.139 --> 00:04:39.190
He also is terribly ashamed and afraid of
his devil fruit powers. Giving a character

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:44.110
a set of well explained and compelling weaknesses
is important in order to make the development

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:48.850
arc interesting and plausible. It helps the
reader to identify and empathize with the

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:54.681
character and create a story that feels natural
and close to reality. In Choppers case, one

00:04:54.681 --> 00:04:59.650
could say that he starts off as a timid and
naïve teenager that has gone through a horrendous

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:05.650
childhood. If monsters are the embodiment
of our fears, Chopper maybe best embodies

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:10.479
our fear of not knowing who we are and where
we belong. I would say, that this is best

00:05:10.479 --> 00:05:16.389
symbolized by his monster point. Something
he can´t control and fears.

00:05:16.389 --> 00:05:20.789
After joining Luffy and the crew, he becomes
the ship´s doctor, making him one of the

00:05:20.789 --> 00:05:25.699
main characters of the story. His great medical
knowledge puts the reindeer in maybe one of

00:05:25.699 --> 00:05:30.590
the most important roles on board. But besides
having to stitch together Luffy every other

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:35.289
island, Chopper also has a bunch of other
abilities and powers that make him unique

00:05:35.289 --> 00:05:40.280
in the crew: Being one of the devil fruit
users on the crew, he is also the only Zoan

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:45.289
type on the ship. This gives him the ability
to fight, even though his insecurity and lack

00:05:45.289 --> 00:05:50.550
of combat experience seem to put him in the
lower tiers of the crew in that regard. Amazingly

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:54.949
enough though, Chopper was able to use his
medical knowledge to create his rumble balls

00:05:54.949 --> 00:05:59.880
that allow him to control and expand his devil
fruit transformation to a certain extend.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:04.370
Something that even Dr. Vegapunk seems to
have failed to achieve. Especially in Wano,

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:08.939
that has a heavy focus on Zoan type devil
fruits, it will be interesting to see weather

00:06:08.939 --> 00:06:14.330
this will play a major role in the story at
some point. Lastly, being an animal himself,

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:19.000
Chopper is able to communicate with other
animals, which on occasions has proven to

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.419
be quite useful to the crew over the course
of their journey.

00:06:22.419 --> 00:06:27.699
Closely connected to Chopper´s skills and
history are also the value, that Oda has attributed

00:06:27.699 --> 00:06:33.120
to his character. Over the course of the journey,
we can clearly see that he values kindness

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:38.590
and friendship deeply. A feeling that intensifies
when traveling with the crew. Having trained

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:43.590
under two kindhearted doctors, Chopper also
strongly values science and believes in its

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:48.849
good nature. In accordance with this, he also
holds the belief that a doctor's duty is to

00:06:48.849 --> 00:06:54.560
help and save anyone. This set of values fit
in smoothly with the rest of the character,

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:59.870
making his action seem authentic and natural.
Furthermore, having a character with a clear

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:04.819
set of values is important in order to test
these values in the confrontation with those

00:07:04.819 --> 00:07:10.250
of an opponent. All of the straw hats are
kind. And while this kindness is often tested

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:14.539
by the cruelty and evil they encounter in
the world, in Chopper´s case in particular

00:07:14.539 --> 00:07:19.900
it is his believe in science, that is challenged.
Especially his encounters with Hogback and

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:25.060
Cesar are especially interesting, because
they also value science but for different

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:30.350
reasons. Giving a character an opponent, who
values the same thing, but from a different

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:35.550
viewpoint, usually makes for the most interesting
conflicts and plot points.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:41.030
Like any other major character, based on these
values and his backstory, Chopper also has

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:46.080
a desire. A desire is something that the character
sets out to fulfill over the course of the

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:51.469
story. In the context of One Piece, this is
nothing else than the notorious dream, that

00:07:51.469 --> 00:07:56.909
every straw hat has. Due to his medical education
and his good heart, Chopper´s dream is to

00:07:56.909 --> 00:08:02.491
make the world a better place by becoming
a doctor that can cure any disease. Especially

00:08:02.491 --> 00:08:07.770
in the new world, we have come across a wide
range of diseases that would pose a real opportunity

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:12.520
for chopper to prove his skill.
Finally, based on his tragic past and the

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:17.169
resulting weaknesses for Chopper´s character
out of this, we now have to look at the psychological

00:08:17.169 --> 00:08:22.070
need, that he has to satisfy over the course
of the story. You can think of the psychological

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:27.280
need as a serious flaw that is hurting our
character in some significant way and is holding

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:32.460
him back. The psychological need is something
that any developing and interesting character

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:37.320
should have. It is something that, alongside
the desire, drives the character´s arc under

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:42.790
the surface until he realizes it is a problem
sooner or later. In Chopper´s case this need

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:48.530
is laid out very clearly by Oda in the story:
Chopper needs to learn to accept and believe

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:54.190
in himself. His lack of confidence and identity
not only hurt him emotionally, but also hold

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:58.510
him back in doing what he wants to do and
keep him from being happy. When he joins the

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:03.290
straw hats on their journey, he also goes
on his own journey to satisfy this need. This

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:08.480
is the premise for his character arc. I think
we can agree, that this set-up makes a lot

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:13.440
of sense, considering his backstory and how
his character was introduced to us.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:18.580
And yet, Oda has made a grave mistake here.
And that mistake, I have come to believe,

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:22.910
might be the reason that Chopper appears as
uninteresting to many readers, compared to

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:28.150
the other straw hats. Because as we have learned,
the psychological need is something affecting

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:32.900
the character himself in some significant
way. This creates a clear path for development

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:36.620
and gives the character a goal that neither
he, nor the reader might be aware of at the

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:41.770
beginning. What makes the character and as
a result the plot surrounding him a lot more

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:46.720
interesting though, is a need that also affects
and hurts those around him in some significant

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:52.900
way or form. A great example of how this might
work, is for example Usopp´s insecurity.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:57.760
Not only did it badly affect himself, but
he also hurt those around him, when deciding

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:02.560
to leave the crew. You can call this the moral
need of a character. And you will find it

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:08.380
in most of your favorite figures in any story.
The big problem with Chopper is: He doesn´t

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:13.030
have one. Oda has written Chopper´s need
in a way, that makes him struggle all with

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:19.050
himself. His timid nature keeps him from projecting
his insecurities on others. This makes for

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:24.670
a decent person, but for weaker plot. Which
is a pity, because initially Oda actually

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:29.560
gave Chopper this hostility towards people.
But Chopper´s ill feelings towards Luffy

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:35.011
and Nami lasted only for a couple of chapters
and it didn´t hurt either´s feelings. In

00:10:35.011 --> 00:10:40.400
other words: Chopper lacks an Usopp-moment.
A situation in which he actively hurt others

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:45.900
and as a result has to deal with the consequences.
Instead Chopper´s struggle is all on the

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:49.110
inside.
Now, as I mentioned before, Chopper is still

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:54.650
an amazing and well-written character. But
I think, this lack of moral need in his development

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:59.320
arc is the main reason people tend to have
a problem with him or downgrade him to nothing

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:03.930
more than a mascot, especially because most
of the other straw hats have been given a

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:07.810
moral need by Oda.
So now that we have looked at how Oda has

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:12.510
created Chopper, we of course also want to
understand how his character has changed over

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:17.600
the course of the story. Developing and changing
a character is essential, in order to keep

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:22.420
him relevant and interesting to the story
and give the reader a sense of time flow and

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:28.780
impact in regard to the plot. That being said,
change doesn´t always equal good change.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:33.480
For example, simply making a character stronger
or change his appearance will not give the

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:39.500
reader any sense of fulfillment. True change
involves a challenging and changing of basic

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:44.210
beliefs. In other words, it means taking the
initial weakness and need of the character

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:49.410
and then changing them by making the character
go through certain actions and situations.

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:54.220
Chopper´s character arc therefore aims at
changing his lack of self-confidence, his

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:59.870
trust issues as well as his naivety and shyness.
There are certain categories of change in

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:04.390
storytelling and the one that applies best
to chopper in my mind, is that of a child

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:09.260
changing into an adult. In other words, challenging
his believes and finding his place in the

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:12.370
world.
On his journey to define himself, he sees

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:17.500
almost anyone on the crew as a role model.
The more time he spent with his crew, the

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:22.100
more accepted and valued Chopper felt, so
much so that upon their reunion after the

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:27.800
time skip Chopper was finally able to completely
leave his characterization as a freak behind.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:33.290
The initial mix between his kind and undeniably
cute personality and his existence as a kind

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:38.170
of biological abomination make this change
the more interesting in my eyes. After the

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:43.570
time skip however, this “monster” Chopper
is replaced almost entirely by the “Cotton

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:48.630
Candy Lover” Chopper. He is no longer portrayed
as a frightening freak of nature and even

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:53.790
the literal monster point has been tamed down.
Even if you might find monster Chopper cooler

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:58.061
on the surface though, sweet Chopper truly
is the natural progression of his character

00:12:58.061 --> 00:13:03.650
after fully putting the pain of his past behind
him. There had always been an underlying sweet

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:08.440
element to “monster” Chopper, and his
development across the series is an uplifting

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:12.900
story of him becoming comfortable enough with
himself through the help of his friends to

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:18.140
allow the cotton candy to overtake the beast.
What makes this monster story so different

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:23.280
from others, is that Chopper doesn´t have
to choose between being human or being a monster

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:28.670
anymore. He was able to accept who he is and
still find his place in the world, being accepted

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:34.040
by his friends. This becomes very clear on
Fishman island, when Chopper transformed into

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:39.420
his Human point. Sanji points out how he doesn't
even look human anymore to which Chopper responds

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:44.601
that he is a monster now.
So, what can we derive from this? Chopper

00:13:44.601 --> 00:13:50.960
has apparently been able to change his shyness
and insecurity into confidence and positivity.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:55.660
He is no longer fighting with his identity
and has also found friends that accept him

00:13:55.660 --> 00:14:00.700
just the way he is. I would argue at this
point, that Chopper, as the only straw hat

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:06.480
so far has completed an entire character arc
until the time skip. And that has two major

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:12.410
implications. On the one hand, I think it
shows us, that Chopper is a great character.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:16.910
Same as many others, I greatly enjoyed him
up until the time skip and I hope you can

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:22.390
see now, why. On the other hand, though, a
completed character arc, with no new psychological

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:27.950
or moral need has rendered Chopper meaningless
in the New World. Until Whole Cake Island

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:34.070
that is. And here my hopes have been going
up immensely. Because after leaving Zou to

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:39.010
go and safe Sanji together with Luffy, Chopper
finally seems to have started a new development

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:44.820
arc. After completing his change from child
to adult, I think, we can see clear signs

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:49.920
that Chopper is starting to change from an
Adult to a Leader. At this point, a quick

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:53.740
warning, if you don´t want to be spoiled
for Whole Cake island or Wano, skip ahead

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:59.110
a bit now. Ready? Okay. The first instance
of this new arc, we can see in Chopper´s

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:03.980
relationship with Carrot, in which he takes
the role of a big brother. This puts him in

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:08.860
the situation to guide and take care of someone
for the very first time. But also, the way

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:13.620
he acts in Whole Cake Island, supporting Luffy
smartly and being an asset much rather than

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:18.580
a hindrance, shows us that something is going
on here. Chopper takes the initiative more

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:23.290
and more. The latest example of this is the
amazing job he did in guiding the Yonko Big

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:28.590
Mom to Udon prison to break out Luffy, after
her memory loss. I would go so far as to say

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:33.610
that Chopper´s new need might be that of
lacking leadership qualities. And he is slowly

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:38.520
working towards gaining them. I definitely
have high hopes for our reindeer and I truly

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:43.420
hope that he will get the character arc that
he truly deserves. I think Chopper has so

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:49.080
much more potential than simply being a mascot.
He is one of the best monsters in storytelling

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:54.710
after all. A cotton candy monster.
Hey everybody. Thank you so much for watching.

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:59.040
Before you run off and get yourself some cotton
candy, I would first love to hear your opinion

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:04.340
on Chopper. Do you think he is an interesting
character or not? And why so? And where do

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:09.630
you see his character arc going in the future?
